# Everything a build writes: cargo's target directory (build/target), the staging folder of a
# build, the pictures of the smoke test, the stamp of setup.bat and the portable builds
# (build/dist).
build/
# cargo's default target directory, in case the configuration in .cargo/config.toml is bypassed.
target/

# Temporary files of atomic writes and of downloads that were interrupted.
*.tmp

# Images written by failing snapshot tests.
*.new.png
*.diff.png

# Rust: backups of rustfmt and debug information beside binaries that were copied around.
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Local environment and editor files.
.env
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Cargo.lock IS tracked: the build uses it with --locked, and CI hashes it for its cache keys.
